<title>JAPAN: Nippon Resibon - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Resibon - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.96		vs	    3.97</p>
<p> Operating	  238 million	 vs	  216 million</p>
<p> Current	    229 million	 vs	  162 million</p>
<p> Net		  129 million	 vs	   89 million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.61 yen	  vs	   13.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares		 7 million	 vs	    7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Resibon Corp is a large manufacturer of grindstones.</p>
</text>
